  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {病院|びょういん}を{受診|じゅしん}する (visit a hospital)\n- {医師|いし}を{受診|じゅしん}する (see a doctor)\n- {受診|じゅしん}{券|けん} (medical examination voucher)\n- {受診|じゅしん}{率|りつ} (consultation rate)\n- {初|はつ}{受診|じゅしん} (first consultation)\n\nA formal and common medical term used in healthcare settings, pamphlets, and official communications. Not to be confused with the homophone {受信|じゅしん} (receiving a signal/message).",
